{
  "analysis": "Round 1 baseline: inclusion is catastrophic (recall ~0.10-0.15, 161/179 missed), scratches weak (0.47, 55 missed), patches decent (0.66, 51 missed). Miss profiles are consistent: small + low-contrast. Inclusion misses are tiny (median 37px vs 90px train) faint thin streaks; scratches misses are short thin bright lines (42px vs 73px); patches misses are small dark blobs (50px vs 85px). So plan: shift all classes toward smaller paste scales with prefer_small weighting, and allocate the bulk of the 50-image budget to inclusion while keeping scratches and patches fed (shared detector).",
  "allocation": {"inclusion": 25, "patches": 10, "scratches": 15},
  "params": {
    "inclusion": {
      "scale_min": 0.35,
      "scale_max": 0.95,
      "target_pool": "same_class",
      "source_weighting": "prefer_small",
      "max_overlap": 0.15,
      "sources": [11, 150, 287, 100, 106, 131, 268, 277]
    },
    "patches": {
      "scale_min": 0.40,
      "scale_max": 1.00,
      "target_pool": "same_class",
      "source_weighting": "prefer_small",
      "max_overlap": 0.15,
      "sources": [14, 106, 161, 164, 219, 241, 251, 272, 65, 70, 82, 86, 96, 240, 39, 63, 94]
    },
    "scratches": {
      "scale_min": 0.30,
      "scale_max": 0.80,
      "target_pool": "same_class",
      "source_weighting": "prefer_small",
      "max_overlap": 0.15,
      "sources": [19, 20, 200, 201, 203, 76, 91, 96, 193, 103, 112, 133, 134, 149, 169, 170, 179, 180, 181, 182, 184, 185, 187, 191, 192]
    }
  },
  "rationale": "Inclusion gets 25/50 because its recall is near zero and misses are dominated by small (37px) low-contrast thin streaks: I selected the faint/thin streak sources (11, 150, 287 plus thin dark streaks 100, 106, 131, 268, 277) and scaled 0.35-0.95 with prefer_small so pastes land in the 30-90px band the detector currently fails on. Scratches (15) target short thin bright lines: thin-line sources only (avoiding the thick bright weld-like streaks that don't match the faint misses), scale 0.30-0.80 to hit the ~42px missed size. Patches (10) keep the class fed with small dark/faint blobs (incl. faint small sources 240, 39, 63, 94) at 0.40-1.00. Same-class backgrounds keep pastes realistic; max_overlap 0.15 avoids clutter. All classes stay >=10 and no class exceeds the 105 cap."
}

